- id: '1769837859221'
  alias: Close curtains if bedroom hot
  description: Close bedroom curtain when hot (>25C for 30s) or 30 min before sunset.
    A 15-minute re-check re-evaluates while the room stays hot, so a missed trigger
    or a stuck entity cannot silently skip the close. Notifies the phone only when
    the curtain entity reads unknown/unavailable (close is still sent blind), so a
    genuine fault is loud and a normal already-closed evaluation stays quiet.
  triggers:
  - id: hot
    entity_id: sensor.bedroom_bluetooth_temperature_temperature
    for:
      hours: 0
      minutes: 0
      seconds: 30
    trigger: numeric_state
    above: 25
  - id: sunset
    event: sunset
    offset: -00:30:00
    trigger: sun
  - id: recheck
    trigger: time_pattern
    minutes: /15
  actions:
  - choose:
    - alias: 'Re-check while hot: close regardless of what the entity claims'
      conditions:
      - condition: trigger
        id: recheck
      - condition: numeric_state
        entity_id: sensor.bedroom_bluetooth_temperature_temperature
        above: 25
      sequence:
      - action: cover.close_cover
        target:
          entity_id: cover.curtain
    - alias: 'Entity stuck: still send the close, then warn me it was blind'
      conditions:
      - condition: trigger
        id:
        - hot
        - sunset
      - condition: state
        entity_id: cover.curtain
        state:
        - unknown
        - unavailable
      sequence:
      - action: cover.close_cover
        target:
          entity_id: cover.curtain
      - action: notify.mobile_app_sm_s938b
        data:
          message: 'Curtain auto-close: cover.curtain reads {{ states(''cover.curtain'')
            }} (stuck). A close command WAS still sent - please check the curtain
            physically.'
          title: Curtain entity stuck - close sent blind
    - alias: 'Confirmed open: normal close'
      conditions:
      - condition: trigger
        id:
        - hot
        - sunset
      - condition: state
        entity_id: cover.curtain
        state: open
      sequence:
      - action: cover.close_cover
        target:
          entity_id: cover.curtain
